  "translation": "Na mi luk: bikos long olgeta as bilong we pasin lusim rot bilong Yisrael i mekim pasin bilong slept wantaim narapela man, mi salim em i go, na mi givim ⟨את⟩ buk bilong rausim kwantrak bilong marit long em; tasol trenstras Yuda, sista bilong em, i no pret, em i go na em salim bodi tu, em yet.",
